msgid "\"Five in a row\" board game"
msgstr "Društvena igra „pet u nizu”"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.bovo.appdata.xml:12
msgid "Bovo is a Gomoku (from Japanese 五目並べ - lit. \"five points\") like game for two players, where the opponents alternate in placing their respective pictogram on the game board. (Also known as: Connect Five, Five in a row, X and O, Naughts and Crosses)"
msgstr "Bovo je igra za dva igrača nalik gomokuu (japanski 五目並べ – doslovno „pet točaka”), u kojoj protivnici naizmjence postavljaju svoje simbole na ploču. Poznata je i kao Connect Five, pet u nizu, iks-oks ili križić-kružić."
